      "observation": "Body records already distinguish inherited Natural balance, trained Conditioned grip and acquired Palm mark. Awakening/activation is paid elapsed-time work, grip practice has stamina/soreness cost, and ordinary recovery preserves permanent marks/learned grip. Active balance contributes route preparation; grip changes actual packing duration and tender hands add work time. No general trait framework is missing.",
