      "observation": "persistExpansionPlan writes staged expansion/native money, gameplay/ownership/equipment/unlocks and optional native projection into the existing copied envelope before storage.setItem. prepareGameplayPublication stages item reconstruction and XP, refusing negative XP without a reset adapter. A new proposal must use this publisher and its matching live host, not Rogue Legacy separate-file/catch-only persistence. Source reading alone does not verify failure atomicity in play.",
